L["A dark curse has fallen over Drustvar. Lord Waycrest has vanished, his lady has withdrawn behind manor walls, and old stories about witches have begun walking through the woods again.\n\nJoin Lucille Waycrest and the Order of Embers as they follow the coven's trail through cursed villages, haunted fens, and a land where buried grudges have a way of clawing back to the surface."] = "A dark curse has fallen over Drustvar. Lord Waycrest has vanished, his lady has withdrawn behind manor walls, and old stories about witches have begun walking through the woods again.\n\nJoin Lucille Waycrest and the Order of Embers as they follow the coven's trail through cursed villages, haunted fens, and a land where buried grudges have a way of clawing back to the surface."
