L["An unexpected message revealed the location of Felo'melorn — the legendary sword of the Sunstrider dynasty, lost when Kael'thas fell. You traced it to the frozen depths of Icecrown, where it had lain since Arthas shattered it in single combat. You reforged the blade in phoenix fire and carried it from the ice, its flames burning hotter than ever — as if centuries of cold had only made it angrier."] = "An unexpected message revealed the location of Felo'melorn — the legendary sword of the Sunstrider dynasty, lost when Kael'thas fell. You traced it to the frozen depths of Icecrown, where it had lain since Arthas shattered it in single combat. You reforged the blade in phoenix fire and carried it from the ice, its flames burning hotter than ever — as if centuries of cold had only made it angrier."
