L["Beneath Dalaran lies the Hall of the Guardian, seat of the ancient Tirisgarde: mages sworn to protect Azeroth from magical threats that ordinary armies cannot understand.\n\nAs the order's newest Archmage, investigate hidden enemies, recover lost allies, and defend the Kirin Tor from dangers that wear familiar faces."] = "Beneath Dalaran lies the Hall of the Guardian, seat of the ancient Tirisgarde: mages sworn to protect Azeroth from magical threats that ordinary armies cannot understand.\n\nAs the order's newest Archmage, investigate hidden enemies, recover lost allies, and defend the Kirin Tor from dangers that wear familiar faces."
