L["Hanzabu, servant of the death loa, led you into Bwonsamdi's Necropolis — a place where the veil between the living and the dead was thin enough to talk through. Bwonsamdi was many things: charming, unsettling, and entirely in control of any room he entered. He had watched the blood trolls desecrate his death shrines and steal souls that were owed to him. He was not pleased. The deal he offered was simple — his power in exchange for one million souls delivered to his realm. You cleansed his temple of spirits who had fled to G'huun, repelled Grand Ma'da Ateena's interruption of the sealing ritual, and sealed the pact. A deal with a death loa is not something you walk back from."] = "Hanzabu, servant of the death loa, led you into Bwonsamdi's Necropolis — a place where the veil between the living and the dead was thin enough to talk through. Bwonsamdi was many things: charming, unsettling, and entirely in control of any room he entered. He had watched the blood trolls desecrate his death shrines and steal souls that were owed to him. He was not pleased. The deal he offered was simple — his power in exchange for one million souls delivered to his realm. You cleansed his temple of spirits who had fled to G'huun, repelled Grand Ma'da Ateena's interruption of the sealing ritual, and sealed the pact. A deal with a death loa is not something you walk back from."
