L["Lordaeron is in Forsaken hands again, but old enemies still haunt the forests beyond its walls. The Scarlet Crusade clings to its strongholds, Gilneas has not forgotten, and a former queen's absence leaves difficult questions behind.\n\nLilian Voss has a mission in Silverpine, and she needs someone who knows what it means to be Forsaken: to stand at a graveside, remember, and choose again what the second life is for."] = "Lordaeron is in Forsaken hands again, but old enemies still haunt the forests beyond its walls. The Scarlet Crusade clings to its strongholds, Gilneas has not forgotten, and a former queen's absence leaves difficult questions behind.\n\nLilian Voss has a mission in Silverpine, and she needs someone who knows what it means to be Forsaken: to stand at a graveside, remember, and choose again what the second life is for."
