L["Lucille realized that scattered witch hunting would never be enough. A slight detour through the mountains — past yetis and salvaged supplies — led to the ruins of Gol Var, where ancient bones whispered of the Order of Embers. Centuries ago, the Order had been Drustvar's shield against the Drust and their dark magic. Lucille read the histories carved in stone and rune-etched bone, and made her decision: the Order of Embers would rise again. She would lead it, and you would be her blade."] = "Lucille realized that scattered witch hunting would never be enough. A slight detour through the mountains — past yetis and salvaged supplies — led to the ruins of Gol Var, where ancient bones whispered of the Order of Embers. Centuries ago, the Order had been Drustvar's shield against the Drust and their dark magic. Lucille read the histories carved in stone and rune-etched bone, and made her decision: the Order of Embers would rise again. She would lead it, and you would be her blade."
