L["Taelia sent you to Drustvar, where Lord Waycrest had vanished and a dark curse was spreading. In Fallhaven, Cyril White led you through the signs of witchcraft — hexed villagers, twisted familiars, and effigies that pulsed with dark magic. You met Lucille Waycrest, the lord's daughter, who refused to sit idle while her land rotted. Together you hunted the witches through Fallhaven, cracking their curses and burning their effigies. The final effigy crumbled, but the witches' power ran far deeper than one village."] = "Taelia sent you to Drustvar, where Lord Waycrest had vanished and a dark curse was spreading. In Fallhaven, Cyril White led you through the signs of witchcraft — hexed villagers, twisted familiars, and effigies that pulsed with dark magic. You met Lucille Waycrest, the lord's daughter, who refused to sit idle while her land rotted. Together you hunted the witches through Fallhaven, cracking their curses and burning their effigies. The final effigy crumbled, but the witches' power ran far deeper than one village."
