L["The Forest Ward revealed Revendreth at its most predatory. The Fearstalker and his hounds called it penance: let condemned souls glimpse escape, then chase them until pride broke under terror. You learned the ritual, stalked the quarry, and watched the Accuser's doubts harden into rebellion. The hunt was supposed to humble sinners, but it had become sport for nobles who fed on fear. By the time you reached Dredhollow and broke the Hopebreakers, the shape of the war was clear. This was not order against chaos. It was cruelty against the last pieces of Revendreth still trying to remember mercy."] = "The Forest Ward revealed Revendreth at its most predatory. The Fearstalker and his hounds called it penance: let condemned souls glimpse escape, then chase them until pride broke under terror. You learned the ritual, stalked the quarry, and watched the Accuser's doubts harden into rebellion. The hunt was supposed to humble sinners, but it had become sport for nobles who fed on fear. By the time you reached Dredhollow and broke the Hopebreakers, the shape of the war was clear. This was not order against chaos. It was cruelty against the last pieces of Revendreth still trying to remember mercy."
