L["The zone ends where its warning began: inside the Temple of the Jade Serpent. The sha has seeped into wisdom, memory, discipline, and flame. Wise Mari, Lorewalker Stonestep, Liu Flameheart, and the temple's defenders are all trapped in doubt's reflection. By cleansing the temple and defeating the Sha of Doubt, you do what the armies outside could not: stop feeding the darkness long enough to face it. The Jade Forest is not untouched anymore. It is wounded, changed, and still alive."] = "The zone ends where its warning began: inside the Temple of the Jade Serpent. The sha has seeped into wisdom, memory, discipline, and flame. Wise Mari, Lorewalker Stonestep, Liu Flameheart, and the temple's defenders are all trapped in doubt's reflection. By cleansing the temple and defeating the Sha of Doubt, you do what the armies outside could not: stop feeding the darkness long enough to face it. The Jade Forest is not untouched anymore. It is wounded, changed, and still alive."
